*ciallo
    # show girl hazukashii
    girl "Ciallo～(∠・ω< )⌒★"
    jump cafe


*cafe
    show girl normal
    girl "歡迎來到星光咖啡館！"
    # show girl amazed
    girl "你想喝點什麽呢"
    call menu_test

    show girl normal
    girl "欢迎下次光临~"
    
    jump end

*menu_test
    menu
    @"冰美式"
        show girl amazed
        girl "美式？那種苦苦的東西難道真是給人喝的？！"
    @"卡布奇诺"
        show girl kowai
        girl "来，给阿姨倒一杯卡布奇诺"
        show girl amazed
        girl "炸它！漂亮~"
    @"酱香拿铁"
        show girl normal
        girl "好嘞，拿铁加面硬加咸蔬菜加倍蒜末和油多多！！"
    @"你"
        show girl kowai
        girl "什麽？！你要..."
        show girl angry
        girl "那是不可能的..."
        show girl hazukashii
        girl "私の０７２１を見てください！"
    end menu
    return